deep\n                inspection of hundreds of protocols.\n </p>  <p class=\"paragraph text-text undefined size-md\">  <b>Open Source and Free Forever.</b> As an open-source tool, Wireshark\n                is freely available for use and distribution, with its source code\n                accessible under the GNU General Public License (GPL). </p>  <p class=\"paragraph text-text undefined size-md\">  <b>Supported by an Active Community.</b> The Wireshark project is\n                supported by a vibrant community of developers and users who contribute\n                to its ongoing development and enhancement. </p>   </div> <div class=\"w-full flex justify-center\"> <a current=\"false\" href=\"/download.html\" class=\"mt-4 button size-sm variant-primary\" data-astro-cid-2hlhkyqe=\"true\">  Get Started Today </a>  </div> </div> <section class=\"bg-border-card p-8 sm:p-16 w-dvw -ml-4 sm:-ml-8\" data-astro-cid-dfx5v3tf> <div class=\"banner-grid grid md:gap-12 gap-4 justify-items-center\" style=\"--md-cols: 3; --lg-cols: 4;\" data-astro-cid-dfx5v3tf> <a current=\"false\" href=\"https://www.endace.com/endaceprobe?utm_source=wireshark&utm_medium=banner&utm_campaign=dl-page\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"m-auto banner-ad-link link text-action size-md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-astro-cid-dfx5v3tf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\">   <img src=\"/_astro/endace.BHKk8StM_Z26cTv1.webp\" alt=\"Banner Ad 1\" data-astro-cid-dfx5v3tf=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\">  </a> <a current=\"false\" href=\"https://profitap.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"m-auto banner-ad-link link text-action size-md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-astro-cid-dfx5v3tf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\">   <img src=\"/_astro/profitap.6E4vc7ps_1tN69a.webp\" alt=\"Banner Ad 2\" data-astro-cid-dfx5v3tf=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\">  </a> <a current=\"fal