 class=\"flex gap-4\"> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" stroke=\"var(--color-action)\" overflow=\"visible\" class=\"icon w-4 size-md\"> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">\n<g clip-path=\"url(#clip0_569_5933)\">\n<path d=\"M4 5.5L1 8L4 10.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" />\n<path d=\"M12 5.5L15 8L12 10.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" />\n<path d=\"M10 2.5L6 13.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" />\n</g>\n<defs>\n</defs>\n</svg> </svg>  Source Code </li>  </a>  </ul>  </div> </details> </li>   </ul><li class=\"item\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <details class=\"wrapper p-4 border-t border-t-border\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <summary class=\"title\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <h5 class=\"py-4 flex items-center justify-between w-full heading\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> Documentation<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" stroke=\"var(--color-text)\" overflow=\"visible\" class=\"icon-chevron icon w-4 size-md\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> <svg width=\"28\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M2 2L14 14L26 2\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n</svg> </svg>  </h5>  </summary> <div class=\"pb-4 content text-text\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o>  <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"> <a current=\"false\" href=\"/docs/wsug_html_chunked/\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">   <li class=\"flex gap-4\">User&#39;s Guide (Multiple Pages)</li>  </a> <a current=\"false\" href=\"/docs/wsug_html/\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">   <li class=\"flex gap-4\">User&#39;s Guide (Single Page)</li>  </a> <a current=\"false\" href=\"/docs/\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">   <li class=\"flex gap-4\">All Documentation</li>  </a>  </ul>  </div> </details> </li>   </ul>  </div> </section> <section class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr> <p class=\"paragraph text-text text-text-headline size-lg\">  Frequently Asked Questions </p>   <ul data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" class=\"accordion w-full border-b border-b-border\">  <li class=\"item\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <details class=\"wrapper p-4 border-t border-t-border\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <summary class=\"title\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <h5 class=\"py-4 flex items-center justify-between w-full heading\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> What platforms does Wireshark support?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" stroke=\"var(--color-text)\" overflow=\"visible\" class=\"icon-chevron icon w-4 size-md\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> <svg width=\"28\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M2 2L14 14L26 2\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n</svg> </svg>  </h5>  </summary> <div class=\"pb-4 content text-text\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o>  <p class=\"paragraph text-text undefined size-md\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\">  \nWireshark runs on most computing platforms including Windows,\n                macOS, Linux, and UNIX. It can also be built from source on\n                other platforms. For more information, see the <a current=\"false\" href=\"/download.html\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">  Download </a>  page.\n </p>   </div> </details> </li>  <li class=\"item\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <details class=\"wrapper p-4 border-t border-t-border\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <summary class=\"title\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <h5 class=\"py-4 flex items-center justify-between w-full heading\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> Is Wireshark really free to use?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" stroke=\"var(--color-text)\" overflow=\"visible\" class=\"icon-chevron icon w-4 size-md\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> <svg width=\"28\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M2 2L14 14L26 2\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n</svg> </svg>  </h5>  </summary> <div class=\"pb-4 content text-text\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o>   <p class=\"paragraph text-text undefined size-md\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\">  Wireshark is \"free software\"; you can download it without\n                    paying any license fee. The version of Wireshark you\n                    download isn't a \"demo\" version, with limitations not\n                    present in a \"full\" version; it is the full version. The\n                    license under which Wireshark is issued is the <a current=\"false\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">  GNU General Public License version 2. </a>  See the <a current=\"false\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0-faq.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">  GNU GPL FAQ </a>  for some more information.\n </p>  <br data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr> <p class=\"paragraph text-text undefined size-md\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\">  \nWireshark is maintained by the <a current=\"false\" href=\"https://wiresharkfoundation.org/\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">  Wireshark Foundation </a> , a non-profit organization dedicated to supporting the\n                    development and distribution of Wireshark. The Foundation is\n                    funded by donations from users and organizations that rely\n                    on Wireshark for their network analysis needs, consider\n                    supporting us by <a current=\"false\" href=\"https://wiresharkfoundation.org/donate/\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">  making a donation! </a>   </p>    </div> </details> </li>  <li class=\"item\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <details class=\"wrapper p-4 border-t border-t-border\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <summary class=\"title\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o> <h5 class=\"py-4 flex items-center justify-between w-full heading\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> Where can I find tutorials and resources?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" stroke=\"var(--color-text)\" overflow=\"visible\" class=\"icon-chevron icon w-4 size-md\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o=\"true\"> <svg width=\"28\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 16\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M2 2L14 14L26 2\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n</svg> </svg>  </h5>  </summary> <div class=\"pb-4 content text-text\" data-astro-cid-swnn7w2o>  <p class=\"paragraph text-text undefined size-md\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\">  \nOur <a current=\"false\" href=\"/learn\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">  Learn </a>  page is a great place\n                to start. Our <a current=\"false\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@WireSharkFest\" target=\"_blank\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\" class=\"link text-action size-md\">  https://www.youtube.com/@WireSharkFest </a>  also has many tutorials and classes on various topics related to\n                network analysis.\n </p>   </div> </details> </li>   </ul> <h5 class=\"text-center heading\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\"> \nStill have questions?<br data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr>\nVisit our <a current=\"false\" href=\"/docs/\" class=\"font-magistral link text-action size-lg\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\">  documentation </a>  or see the full <a current=\"false\" href=\"/faq\" class=\"font-magistral link text-action size-lg\" data-astro-cid-al2ca2vr=\"true\" data-astro-cid-c3we5kpz=\"true\">  FAQ. </a>   </h5>  </section> <script>(function(){const placement = \"homepage\";\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.partner-link').forEach(function(link) {\n        link.addEventListener('click', function() {\n            const partnerName = link.getAttribute('data-partner') || 'unknown';\n            if (typeof gtag !== 'undefined') {\n                gtag('event', 'partner_click', {\n                    partner_name: partnerName,\n                    placement: placement\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    });\n})();</script> <div id=\"donation-modal-backdrop\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\" style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.45);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);display:none;\"> <div id=\"donation-modal\" class=\"bg-background border border-border rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-3xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Support Wireshark\"> <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row\"> <!-- Left column --> <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 p-6 md:p-8 md:w-1/2 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-border\"> <h2 class=\"font-magistral text-2xl font-bold text-text\">Your download has started.</h2> <p class=\"text-text-secondary text-sm\">While you wait, please consider supporting the project.</p> <p class=\"text-text-secondary text-xs\">\nIf the download didn't start,\n<a id=\"donation-modal-manual-link\" href=\"#\" class=\"text-action underline\">download manually</a>.\n</p> </div> <!-- Right column --> <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 p-6 md:p-8 md:w-1/2\"> <!-- Frequency toggle --> <div class=\"flex rounded-lg border border-border overflow-hidden\"> <button class=\"donation-freq-btn flex-1 py-2 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-center transition-colors bg-transparent text-text\" data-type=\"recurring\" type=\"butto